// A second peer job in the same second keeps its own file.
// The first id shape stays. The first body stays.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE keep ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law ROLE nanobot PROTON 1

PLUG keep law

IMPULSE keep 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "keep" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
